{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23404","headline":"知足吟 · 白居易","name":"知足吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不种一陇田，仓中有余粟。\n不采一株桑，箱中有余服。\n官闲离忧责，身泰无羁束。\n中人百户税，宾客一年禄。\n樽中不乏酒，篱下仍多菊。\n是物皆有余，非心无所欲。\n吟君未贫作，因歌知足曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}